#: ../../../platforms/linux_x86_64.rst:22
msgid ""
"Linux x86_64 (64-bit) is a Unix-like and mostly POSIX-compliant computer "
"operating system (OS) assembled under the model of free and open-source "
"software development and distribution. Using host OS (Mac OS X or Linux 64-"
"bit) you can build native application for Linux x86_64 platform."
msgstr ""

